    <item>
      <title>AIC3204</title>
      <link>http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac/aic3204/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac/aic3204/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;aic3204&lt;/code&gt; platform allows your ESPHome devices to use the AIC3204 ultra low power stereo audio codec (DAC).&#xA;This allows the playback of audio via the microcontroller from a range of sources via&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/media_player/&#34;&gt;Media Player Components&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/i2c#i2c&#34;&gt;I²C bus&lt;/a&gt; is required in your configuration as this is used to communicate with the AIC3204.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;code-block&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;button class=&#34;copy-button&#34; aria-label=&#34;Copy code&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&#xA;             role=&#34;none&#34;&#xA;             width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34;&#xA;             stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34;&#xA;             stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;rect x=&#34;9&#34; y=&#34;9&#34; width=&#34;13&#34; height=&#34;13&#34; rx=&#34;2&#34; ry=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;/rect&gt;&#xA;            &lt;path d=&#34;M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;copy-feedback&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;codeblock-content&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-yaml&#34; data-lang=&#34;yaml&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c&#34;&gt;# Example configuration entry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;audio_dac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;l&#34;&gt;aic3204&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; id=&#34;config-aic3204&#34; role=&#34;none&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2  id=&#34;configuration-variables&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Configuration variables&#xA;    &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;copy-link dark-invert&#34; data-anchor=&#34;configuration-variables&#34; title=&#34;Copy link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/link.svg&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;address&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;, int): The I²C address of the driver. Defaults to &lt;code&gt;0x18&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;i2c_id&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;): The ID of the &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/i2c#i2c&#34;&gt;I²C bus&lt;/a&gt; the AIC3204 is connected to.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;All other options from &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac#config-audio_dac&#34;&gt;Audio DAC&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2  id=&#34;automations&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Automations&#xA;    &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;copy-link dark-invert&#34; data-anchor=&#34;automations&#34; title=&#34;Copy link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/link.svg&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3  id=&#34;aic3204set_auto_mute_mode-action&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;code&gt;aic3204.set_auto_mute_mode&lt;/code&gt; Action&#xA;    &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;copy-link dark-invert&#34; data-anchor=&#34;aic3204set_auto_mute_mode-action&#34; title=&#34;Copy link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/link.svg&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This action sets the auto-mute mode of the AIC3204. See page 111 in the&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.ti.com/lit/ml/slaa557/slaa557.pdf?ts=1727495047647&amp;amp;ref_url=ti.com&#34;&gt;reference manual&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>ES8156</title>
      <link>http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac/es8156/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac/es8156/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;es8156&lt;/code&gt; platform allows your ESPHome devices to use the ES8156 low power mono audio codec.&#xA;This allows the playback of audio via the microcontroller from a range of sources via &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/speaker/&#34;&gt;Speaker Components&lt;/a&gt; or&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/media_player/&#34;&gt;Media Player Components&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/i2c#i2c&#34;&gt;I²C bus&lt;/a&gt; is required in your configuration as this is used to communicate with the ES8156.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;code-block&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;button class=&#34;copy-button&#34; aria-label=&#34;Copy code&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&#xA;             role=&#34;none&#34;&#xA;             width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34;&#xA;             stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34;&#xA;             stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;rect x=&#34;9&#34; y=&#34;9&#34; width=&#34;13&#34; height=&#34;13&#34; rx=&#34;2&#34; ry=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;/rect&gt;&#xA;            &lt;path d=&#34;M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;copy-feedback&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;codeblock-content&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-yaml&#34; data-lang=&#34;yaml&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c&#34;&gt;# Example configuration entry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;audio_dac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;l&#34;&gt;es8156&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; id=&#34;config-es8156&#34; role=&#34;none&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2  id=&#34;configuration-variables&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Configuration variables&#xA;    &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;copy-link dark-invert&#34; data-anchor=&#34;configuration-variables&#34; title=&#34;Copy link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/link.svg&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;address&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;, int): The I²C address of the driver. Defaults to &lt;code&gt;0x18&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;i2c_id&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;): The ID of the &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/i2c#i2c&#34;&gt;I²C bus&lt;/a&gt; the ES8156 is connected to.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;All other options from &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac#config-audio_dac&#34;&gt;Audio DAC&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2  id=&#34;automations&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Automations&#xA;    &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;copy-link dark-invert&#34; data-anchor=&#34;automations&#34; title=&#34;Copy link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/link.svg&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;All &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac#automations-audio_dac&#34;&gt;Audio DAC Automations&lt;/a&gt; are supported by this platform.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>ES8311</title>
      <link>http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac/es8311/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac/es8311/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;es8311&lt;/code&gt; platform allows your ESPHome devices to use the ES8311 low power mono audio codec.&#xA;This allows the playback of audio via the microcontroller from a range of sources via &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/speaker/&#34;&gt;Speaker Components&lt;/a&gt; or&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/media_player/&#34;&gt;Media Player Components&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/i2c#i2c&#34;&gt;I²C bus&lt;/a&gt; is required in your configuration as this is used to communicate with the ES8311.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;code-block&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;button class=&#34;copy-button&#34; aria-label=&#34;Copy code&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&#xA;             role=&#34;none&#34;&#xA;             width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34;&#xA;             stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34;&#xA;             stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;rect x=&#34;9&#34; y=&#34;9&#34; width=&#34;13&#34; height=&#34;13&#34; rx=&#34;2&#34; ry=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;/rect&gt;&#xA;            &lt;path d=&#34;M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;copy-feedback&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;codeblock-content&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-yaml&#34; data-lang=&#34;yaml&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c&#34;&gt;# Example configuration entry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;audio_dac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;l&#34;&gt;es8311&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; id=&#34;config-es8311&#34; role=&#34;none&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2  id=&#34;configuration-variables&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Configuration variables&#xA;    &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;copy-link dark-invert&#34; data-anchor=&#34;configuration-variables&#34; title=&#34;Copy link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/link.svg&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;bits_per_sample&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;, enum): The bit depth of the audio samples. One of &lt;code&gt;16bit&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;24bit&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;32bit&lt;/code&gt;. Defaults to &lt;code&gt;16bit&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;sample_rate&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;, positive integer): I2S sample rate. Defaults to &lt;code&gt;16000&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;use_mclk&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;, bool): Use the MCLK signal to control the clock. Defaults to &lt;code&gt;True&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;use_microphone&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;, bool): Configure the codec&amp;rsquo;s ADC for microphone input. Defaults to &lt;code&gt;False&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;mic_gain&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;, enum): The gain applied to the ADC microphones. One of &lt;code&gt;MIN&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;0DB&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;6DB&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;12DB&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;18DB&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;24DB&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;30DB&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;36DB&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;42DB&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;MAX&lt;/code&gt;. Defaults to &lt;code&gt;42DB&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;address&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;, int): The I²C address of the driver. Defaults to &lt;code&gt;0x18&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;i2c_id&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;em&gt;Optional&lt;/em&gt;): The ID of the &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/i2c#i2c&#34;&gt;I²C bus&lt;/a&gt; the ES8311 is connected to.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;All other options from &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac#config-audio_dac&#34;&gt;Audio DAC&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2  id=&#34;automations&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Automations&#xA;    &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;copy-link dark-invert&#34; data-anchor=&#34;automations&#34; title=&#34;Copy link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/link.svg&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;All &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac#automations-audio_dac&#34;&gt;Audio DAC Automations&lt;/a&gt; are supported by this platform.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>ES8388</title>
      <link>http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac/es8388/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:8000/components/audio_dac/es8388/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;es8388&lt;/code&gt; component allows your ESPHome devices to use the es8388 low power audio codec (&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.everest-semi.com/pdf/ES8388%20DS.pdf&#34;&gt;datasheet&lt;img data-pagefind-ignore=&#34;all&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;external-link dark-invert&#34; title=&#34;External link&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:8000/images/external-link.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&#xA;This allows the playback of audio through two channel high performance audio DAC output via the microcontroller from a range of sources via &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/speaker/&#34;&gt;Speaker Components&lt;/a&gt; or&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/media_player/&#34;&gt;Media Player Components&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It also allows your ESPHome devices to use the &lt;code&gt;es8388&lt;/code&gt;  high performance two channel audio ADC.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This allows attached microphones to be used as a microphone input via &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:8000/components/microphone/i2s_audio/&#34;&gt;I²S Audio Microphone&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
  </channel>
